{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Ready Set Rumble!</h2>Have a blast with friends and family alike in chaotic survival battles!<br>\u200bSonic Rumble is the first multiplayer party game in the iconic game series, with up to 32 players battling it out!<br>Who will be the world\u2019s top Rumbler?!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2951690/extras/4dc955af185bca901ef780ba6cc04197.poster.avif?t=1761179448\" width=616 height=314 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2951690/extras/4dc955af185bca901ef780ba6cc04197.webm?t=1761179448\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2951690/extras/4dc955af185bca901ef780ba6cc04197.mp4?t=1761179448\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25a0\u25a0 Explore a world full of charming stages and exciting game modes! \u25a0\u25a0</h2>Experience a vast array of stages with different themes and ways to play!<br>Rumble is packed with different gameplay styles, including Run, where players race for the top spot, Survival, where players compete to stay in the game, Ring Battle, where players duke and dodge it out for the most rings, and lots more! Matches are short, so anyone can pick it up and play in their spare time.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2951690/extras/2ef0c1f3e5d1c2eb1dd0fa3ca0eae8ac.poster.avif?t=1761179448\" width=616 height=314 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2951690/extras/2ef0c1f3e5d1c2eb1dd0fa3ca0eae8ac.webm?t=1761179448\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2951690/extras/2ef0c1f3e5d1c2eb1dd0fa3ca0eae8ac.mp4?t=1761179448\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25a0\u25a0 Play with friends and family alike! \u25a0\u25a0</h2>Form a squad of 4 players and work together to take on other squads around the world!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2951690/extras/2fd27206b36924e662dc7f5c38f38557.avif?t=1761179448\" width=616 height=314 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25a0\u25a0 All your favorite Sonic characters are here! \u25a0\u25a0</h2>Play as Sonic, Tails, Knuckles, Amy, Shadow, Dr. Eggman, and other Sonic-series favorites!<br>Customize your characters to your heart\u2019s content with a variety of character skins, animations, effects, and more!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2951690/extras/23e382d15631fd0585072c5a2e9b9584.poster.avif?t=1761179448\" width=616 height=314 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2951690/extras/23e382d15631fd0585072c5a2e9b9584.webm?t=1761179448\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2951690/extras/23e382d15631fd0585072c5a2e9b9584.mp4?t=1761179448\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25a0\u25a0 Game Setting \u25a0\u25a0</h2>Players control a character from the Sonic series as they enter a toy world created by the villainous Dr. Eggman, making their way through treacherous obstacle courses and dangerous arenas!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2951690/extras/063486276c121d876fbb3e366bd5194d.avif?t=1761179448\" width=616 height=314 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25a0\u25a0 Loads of music brings the world of Sonic Rumble to life! \u25a0\u25a0</h2>Sonic Rumble features sprightly audio for those with a need for speed!<br>Keep an ear out for iconic tunes from the Sonic series as well!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2951690/extras/bc00dd84801a0be39ddd3f1c122f39bd.avif?t=1761179448\" width=616 height=314 /></span>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2951690?t=1761179448","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2951690/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1761179448","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2951690/8856a52193949609b699275edab1ddd2dc9221db/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761179448","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2951690/8856a52193949609b699275edab1ddd2dc9221db/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761179448","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"In-App Purchases","id":35}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Ready Set Rumble!</h2>Have a blast with friends and family alike in chaotic survival battles!<br>\u200bSonic Rumble is the first multiplayer party game in the iconic game series, with up to 32 players battling it out!<br>Who will be the world\u2019s top Rumbler?!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2951690/extras/4dc955af185bca901ef780ba6cc04197.poster.avif?t=1761179448\" width=616 height=314 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2951690/extras/4dc955af185bca901ef780ba6cc04197.web